    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG Doyle are delighted to present this spacious and bright 2-bedroom ground floor apartment with its own entrance door and extending c. 68 sq. m. This superb property would make an ideal starter home or investment opportunity.\n \nCURRENT MARKET VALUE RENT AS PER THE RTB RENT REGISTER IS 2,000 PER MONTH. \nGROSS INVESTMENT YIELD 7% \n\nRochford Park is ideally located in the heart of Kill Village, just off the Dublin Road, offering a perfect blend of peace and convenience. The property is within easy reach of Dublin City Centre and just 5 minutes from Naas town, with its excellent range of amenities, making this an ideal choice for the Dublin commuter.\n\nAccommodation comprises:\nEntrance Porch\nLiving Room\nKitchen\nTwo Double Bedrooms\nBathroom\n\nOutside this gated development is communal parking and beautifully maintained grounds.\n\nViewing comes recommended!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Porch: - \nWith wood flooring.\n\n- - \n\n\nLiving Room : - 5.456 x 3.982\nA large bright living room, with wood flooring, coving & TV point. Double door into the kitchen.\n\n- - \n\n\nKitchen Dining Room : - 4.34 x 3.74\nA large room with ample floor & wall units, tiled splash back, sink, built in oven, hob & extractor fan & plumbed for washing machine. Sliding patio door to communal area.\n\n- - \n\n\nBedroom 1 : - 3.507 x 3.031\nA double facing the front with wood floor and built in wardrobes.\n\n- - \n\n\nBedroom 2 : - 3.853 x 2.688\nA double room with wood flooring and built in wardrobes.\n\n- - \n\n\nBathroom : - 3.786 x 3.348\nWith tiled floor, part tiled walls & splash back, w.h.b., w.c., medicine cabinet, bath with pumped shower and guard. Window and electric heater. Hotpress:With shelving and storage.\n\n- - \n\n\nOutside : - \nOutside is communal parking, green areas and electric gate access.\n\n- - \n\n\nDisclaimer : - \nThe above are issued by DNG Doyle Naas on the understanding that all negotiations are conducted through them. Every care is taken in preparing particulars which are issued for guidance purposes only and neither the form nor the agent holds themselves responsible for any inaccuracies. The purchaser is advised to make their own arrangements to satisfy themselves with measurements, details and contents include conditions.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Secure gated development</li><li> Ground floor apartment</li><li> Own Entrance door</li><li> Spacious accommodation extending to c. 68.3 sq. m.</li><li> Bright, light-filled accommodation</li><li> 2 double bedrooms</li><li> Ideal for first time buyers and investors</li><li> Allocated car parking spaces</li><li> Commual Grounds</li><li> Within walking distance of all local amenities in Kill</li><li> Within easy commuting distance of Dublin via the M7 motorway</li><li> Management fees approx: 1,200 p.a.</ul>"
      },
